OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump lands at Dublin
OL,4,AAirport for two-day visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has just
OL,7,Ftouched down at Dublin Airport for the
OL,8,Fstart of his two-day visit to the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland
OL,11,FA red carpet is rolled out for the
OL,12,Fpresident's arrival as he is greeted by
OL,13,Fsenior figures of the Irish government
OL,15,FTrump is due to hold a courtesy call
OL,16,Fwith Irish President Catherine
OL,17,FConnolly, and a bilateral meeting with
OL,18,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,19,FMicheal Martin
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
