OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump lands at Dublin
OL,4,AAirport for two-day visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump will then travel to his golf
OL,7,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare, where
OL,8,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament is being
OL,9,Fheld
OL,11,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,12,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,13,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,14,Foperations in the history of the state
OL,16,FProtests against the president's visit
OL,17,Fare expected to be held in Dublin and
OL,18,FDoonbeg
